Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.60,0:00:58.60,Note,,0,0,0,,(曼宁 科罗拉多 现在)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.39,0:00:58.60,Note,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.18,0:04:39.32,Note,,0,0,0,,《邪恶力量》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.12,0:00:03.56,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邪恶力量前情提要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Previously on Supernatural
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.57,0:00:04.67,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 爸爸 - 萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Dad. - Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.83,0:00:06.42,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这比你想象的要大 他们无处不在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is bigger than you think.They're everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:09.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果是这个魔鬼杀害了妈妈和杰西的话 爸爸就会在附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This demon killed Mom and Jess, and Dad's closing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.21,0:00:10.67,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们要去帮忙 - 爸爸不要我们帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- We gotta help. - Dad doesn't want our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.84,0:00:14.51,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是想再多待一个星期 来找到答案 去复仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm talking one week here, man.To get answers. To get revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.72,0:00:17.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你认为我不尊重爸爸 - 抱歉 - 我尊重他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You think l didn't respect Dad. - Sorry - I brought it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.60,0:00:19.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论我做什么都不够优秀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No matter what, it was never good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.60,0:00:21.48,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说什么 爸爸对你很失望吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, what, Dad was disappointed in you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.48,0:00:23.31,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当我们最终找到爸爸的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When we finally do find Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.48,0:00:25.64,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道他是否愿意看到我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l don't know if he's even gonna wanna see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.81,0:00:28.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嘿 爸爸 - 嘿 孩子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Hey. Dad?Hey, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.82,0:00:30.86,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嗨 萨姆 - 嗨 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Hi, Sam. - Hey, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.03,0:00:33.49,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上次我们见面的时候 我们狠狠的吵了一架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Last time we were together we had one hell of a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.65,0:00:35.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是的 - 再次见到你真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Yes, sir. - lt's good to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.16,0:00:37.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好久不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.12,0:00:41.12,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们差点害死爸爸 它们不会就此罢手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We almost got Dad killed in there.They're not gonna stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.29,0:00:43.62,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们还会再试的 它们会利用我们来杀他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're gonna try again.They're gonna use us to get to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.79,0:00:45.37,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当爸爸和我们在一起的时候 他容易被攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad's vulnerable when he's with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.54,0:00:48.46,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我要参与战斗 - 萨姆 这场战斗才刚开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- l gotta be a part of this fight. - Sammy, this fight is just starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.63,0:00:50.54,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你必须让我走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You gotta let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.82,0:01:12.78,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是埃尔金斯先生吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Elkins?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.36,0:01:18.32,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}埃尔金斯先生 你还要一杯吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Elkins. Would you like another?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.41,0:01:20.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 谢谢 贝丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah. Thanks, Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.33,0:01:26.41,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还以为他们抓到了那个递送邮包炸弹者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thought they caught the Unabomber.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.58,0:01:29.42,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 可怜的埃尔金斯先生 独自一个人住在峡谷里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, poor Mr. Elkins lives all alone, up the canyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.79,0:01:32.17,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每天都坐在这个位置上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Same seat every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.34,0:01:35.09,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看他的报纸 记笔记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Going through his papers, and making his little notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.55,0:01:37.84,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是个不错的老人 只是有点神经质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's a nice old man, he's just a nut.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.80,0:01:42.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.83,0:02:09.46,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要点什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What will you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.87,0:02:12.21,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 别带瓶子 Jack All Around - 你饿了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Jack all around. Leave the bottle. - You hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.04,0:02:16.09,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们另有安排 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- We have dinner plans. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.38,0:02:21.39,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还要其他的吗埃尔金斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can l get you something else, Mr. Elkins?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.89,0:03:10.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好久不见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.69,0:03:12.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不得不说 你看起来很苍老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I gotta say, you look old.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.77,0:03:14.98,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想要干什么 你认为呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What do you want? - What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.40,0:03:19.11,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.16,0:03:24.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能干得更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can do better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.67,0:03:37.04,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快 快 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come-Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.71,0:04:21.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nice gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.88,0:04:25.38,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你当然不会做得很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wouldn't do you much good, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.59,0:04:27.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}男孩们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.00,0:04:29.97,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今晚我们开吃吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're eating in tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.62,0:04:54.41,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兄弟 整个内华达州都没有什么合适的 你发现什么了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dude, not a decent lead in all of Nebraska. What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.58,0:04:57.71,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 我正在扫描怀俄明州 科罗拉多州和南达科塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, l've been scanning Wyoming, Colorado, South Dakota.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.88,0:05:01.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里 一个爱荷华州的妇女从一万英尺的飞机上掉下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here, a woman in lowa fell 10, 000 feet from an airplane
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.26,0:05:02.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}依然活下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.42,0:05:05.72,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听起来更象是 不可思议 而不是什么灵异事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sounds more That's Incredible!than Twilight Zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.88,0:05:08.09,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 没错 - 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Yeah. - Hey, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.26,0:05:09.89,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不如我们干脆一直往东走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we could just keep heading east.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.05,0:05:12.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}纽约附近偏僻的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}New York? Upstate?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.27,0:05:14.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以顺道再去看看莎拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You could stop by and see Sarah again, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.10,0:05:16.77,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是个好女孩 兄弟 棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's a cool chick, man. Smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.23,0:05:20.56,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们两个好象关系不错 怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You two seemed pretty friendly.What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.73,0:05:24.44,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我不知道 也许改天吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, l don't know. Maybe someday.But in the meantime...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.61,0:05:27.24,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是在这期间 我们还有很多工作要做 迪恩 你是知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we got a lot of work to do, Dean, and you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.74,0:05:30.24,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 你说得对 还找到什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, you're right. What else you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.91,0:05:34.54,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}科罗拉多的一个男人 当地人 叫他丹尼尔·埃尔金斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Uh, Manning, Colorado. A local man by the name of Daniel Elkins...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.75,0:05:39.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 在他家里被发现血肉模糊 - 埃尔金斯 我听过那个名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- ...was found mauled in his home. - Elkins? I know that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.42,0:05:41.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可没什么印象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Doesn't ring a bell. - Elkins. Elkins. Elkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.67,0:05:43.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来警察一头雾水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The police don't know what to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.42,0:05:46.01,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开始他们说是熊干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At first they said it was some bear attack...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.17,0:05:48.34,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而现在他们又说发现 被抢劫的迹象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and now they found signs of robbery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.55,0:05:49.76,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.97,0:05:51.47,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.77,0:05:58.27,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里 看一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There. Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.69,0:06:04.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认为是同一个埃尔金斯吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Think it's the same Elkins?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.99,0:06:06.32,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是科罗拉多州的地区代码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}lt's a Colorado area code.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.19,0:06:48.07,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看起来女仆今天没来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Looks like the maid didn't come today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.16,0:06:56.24,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 屋内到处是盐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, there's salt here, right inside the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.41,0:06:58.54,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是说象"降伏魔鬼"的盐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You mean like protection-against-demons salt...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.70,0:07:00.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是"我打翻了爆米花"那种盐？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or oops-l-spilled-the-popcorn salt?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.67,0:07:02.67,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明显的 这是个陷阱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's clearly a ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.67,0:07:09.67,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是说那个埃尔金斯也是捉鬼的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You think this guy Elkins was a player?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.84,0:07:11.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肯定是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.64,0:07:22.94,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这看起来和爸爸的日记太象了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That looks a hell of a lot like Dad's.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.11,0:07:27.02,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了这个要回溯到60年代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, except this dates backto the '60s.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.51,0:07:54.89,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论是什么攻击了他 看起来都不是一个人干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whatever attacked him, it looks like there was more than one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.09,0:07:57.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看起来他也经历了艰苦的战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Looks like he put up a hell of a fight too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.26,0:07:58.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.58,0:08:28.17,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找到什么了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You got something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.21,0:08:32.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道 地板上有一些抓痕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know. Some scratches in the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.97,0:08:36.47,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许是垂死挣扎时留下的 也许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Death throes, maybe? - Yeah, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.66,0:08:57.74,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者是某种信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or maybe a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.99,0:09:01.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看起来熟悉吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.25,0:09:05.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}3个字母 6个数字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Three letters, six digits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:09.38,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}组合起来象是邮政信箱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The location and combination of a post office box.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.88,0:09:12.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 这是个邮箱号码 - 和爸爸做事的方法一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- lt's a mail drop. - lt's just the way Dad does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.82,0:09:35.57,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}"J. -W. -" 你觉得是 约翰·温彻斯特吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"J.W." You think? John Winchester?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:37.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道 我们该打开吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know. Should we open it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.87,0:09:43.58,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.29,0:09:48.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸 你在这里干什么？你还好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you doing here?Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.17,0:09:49.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, l'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.92,0:09:51.84,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瞧 我看到了关于丹尼的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, l read the news about Daniel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.00,0:09:53.67,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就尽快赶过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I got here as fast as l could.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.67,0:09:57.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看到你们正好在他的家里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I saw you two up at his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.55,0:10:01.14,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 为什么你不进去 爸爸 - 你知道为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Why didn't you come in, Dad? - You know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.30,0:10:03.64,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我要确定你们没有被跟踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because I had to make sure you weren't followed...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.81,0:10:07.18,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被任何人 任何东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by anyone or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.31,0:10:10.56,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}顺便说下 你们的行踪掩盖得很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nice job of covering your tracks, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.40,0:10:13.44,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我们向最棒的人学的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, well, we learned from the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.61,0:10:16.44,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等 你不辞辛劳跑来就是为了这个埃尔金斯吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait, so you came all the way out here for this Elkins guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.07,0:10:19.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah. He was...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.28,0:10:21.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是 他是个很好的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.16,0:10:24.62,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他教了我很多打猎的知识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He taught me a hell of a lot about hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.24,0:10:27.08,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你从没给我们说过他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, you never mentioned him to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.71,0:10:29.66,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We had a...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.42,0:10:33.04,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们闹翻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We had kind of a falling-out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.75,0:10:35.46,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好几年没见到他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hadn't seen him in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.55,0:10:39.09,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要看看那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I should look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.60,0:10:51.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你看到这个说明 我已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"If you're reading this, I'm already dead."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.27,0:10:54.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 狗娘养的 - 这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- That son of a bitch. - What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.57,0:10:56.73,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 原来那东西一直在他那 - 什么 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- He had it the whole time. - Dad, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.90,0:10:59.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当你们搜寻这个地方的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When you searched the place, did you see a gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.57,0:11:01.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是否看到一把古董的左轮手枪 你们看到了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An antique, a Colt revolver.Did you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.11,0:11:04.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那里有个旧盒子 但是是空的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Uh, there was an old case, but it was empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.20,0:11:05.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 他们得到了 - 你的意思是什么杀害了埃尔金斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- They have it. - You mean whatever killed Elkins?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.16,0:11:08.58,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们必须去看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We gotta pick up the trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.83,0:11:13.38,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 等等 你要我们陪你去吗 - 如果埃尔金斯说的是事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Wait, you want us to come with you? - lf Elkins was telling the truth...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.58,0:11:15.84,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们就必须找到这把枪 - 那把枪 为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- ...we've gotta find this gun. - The gun? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.00,0:11:17.51,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为它很重要 这就是原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because it's important, that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.51,0:11:19.34,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们目前甚至不知道到底是什么鬼怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We don't know what these things are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.51,0:11:22.22,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是丹尼尔·埃尔金斯以前最擅长猎杀的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They were what Daniel Elkins killed best:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.39,0:11:23.72,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.51,0:11:27.14,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吸血鬼 我还认为他们不存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Vampires?I thought there was no such thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.31,0:11:28.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你甚至从没提起过它们 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You never even mentioned them, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.85,0:11:31.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以为他们灭绝了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought they were extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.23,0:11:36.02,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以为埃尔金斯和其他人 把他们都铲除了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought Elkins and others had wiped them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.32,0:11:40.82,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来我错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.32,0:11:44.57,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大多数关于吸血鬼的说法都是错的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Most vampire lore is crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.74,0:11:48.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}十字架不能击败他们 阳光不能杀死他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A cross won't repel them, sunlight won't kill them...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.66,0:11:50.37,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用树桩插进心脏 也不能杀死他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and neither Will a stake to the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.37,0:11:52.29,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是他们嗜血的这部分是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but the blood lust, that part's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.46,0:11:54.46,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们靠吸人类新鲜的血生存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They need fresh human blood to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.63,0:11:57.46,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们曾经是人 所以当你发现他们是吸血鬼的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They were once people, so you won't know it's a vampire until
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.46,0:11:58.84,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就已经太晚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.84,0:12:00.88,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全是你的 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All yours, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.56,0:12:08.89,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.06,0:12:11.39,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我猜想你向那个人炫耀了 - 什么人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Well, l guess you showed that guy. - What guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.85,0:12:13.98,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个打赌你不会买这件衬衫的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The guy who bet you you wouldn't buy that shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.15,0:12:15.48,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我喜欢这件衬衫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I love this shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.57,0:12:19.82,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.91,0:12:27.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 他怎么样了 - 打911\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What happened to him? - Call 911.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.68,0:12:55.64,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}41英里处 有辆废弃的汽车 你要检查吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mile marker 41, abandoned car.You need a Workup?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.81,0:13:00.48,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}收到 可能能在这里取证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Copy that. Possible 207.better get Forensics out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.53,0:13:06.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 迪恩 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sam, Dean, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.16,0:13:09.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 收到一个报警电话 - 发生什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I picked up a police call. - What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.24,0:13:11.66,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一对夫妇打了911 说他们发现一具尸体在路上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A couple called 911, found a body in the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.83,0:13:14.62,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警察赶到那里 所有人都不见了 是吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cops got there, everyone was missing.It's the vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.83,0:13:16.04,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.25,0:13:17.96,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我来 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just follow me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.88,0:13:24.38,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吸血鬼 每次我听到这个词 就觉得可笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Vampires.Gets funnier every time l hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.01,0:13:33.14,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不明白为什么我们 不能和他一起过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l don't see why we couldn't have gone with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.31,0:13:36.56,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 别告诉我已经开始了 开始什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Oh, don't tell me it's already starting. - What's starting?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.23,0:13:39.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 发现什么了 - 就是他们 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What do you got? - lt was them, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.40,0:13:41.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看起来他们似乎向东去了 我们不得不倒回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Looks like they're heading west.We have to get
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.95,0:13:42.57,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到那些小道上转转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}around that detour.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.73,0:13:44.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你怎么这么肯定 - 萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- How can you be sure? - Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.19,0:13:46.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只想知道我们走的是正确的方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I just wanna know we're going in the right direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.90,0:13:48.53,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是正确的 - 你怎么知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- We are. - How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.78,0:13:52.49,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发现这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I found this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.25,0:13:56.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是什么 吸血鬼的犬牙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a vampire fang.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.41,0:13:59.08,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是犬牙 是獠牙 它们袭击人的时候才会出现的牙齿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No fangs, teeth. A second set descends when they attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.71,0:14:02.42,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有问题吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Any more questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.51,0:14:07.76,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们离开这里 天快黑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, let's get out of here, we're losing daylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.93,0:14:11.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 在车生锈前你为什么不擦擦？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, Dean, why don't you touch up you car before you get rust.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.22,0:14:12.64,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我真不该给你这玩意儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wouldn't have given you the damn thing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.64,0:14:14.81,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我早知道你会让它生锈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if l thought you were gonna ruin it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.11,0:14:24.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吸血鬼们是8到10个群居\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Vampires nest in groups of eight to 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.07,0:14:27.28,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}年轻的被派出去寻找食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Smaller packs are sent out to hunt for food.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.44,0:14:28.78,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把战利品活着 带回他们群居的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Victims are taken to the nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.95,0:14:33.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让他们流血 几天到几周\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The pack keeps them alive, bleeding them for days or weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.20,0:14:35.87,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想知道这是否发生在 打911的那对夫妇身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wonder if that's what happened to that 911 couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.04,0:14:37.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那有可能 爸爸怎么看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's probably what Dad's thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.87,0:14:41.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 正如他告诉我们的一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Course, it would be nice if he just told us what he thinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.21,0:14:43.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}果然开始了对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So it is starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.88,0:14:46.38,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.63,0:14:49.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 我们一年都在找寻爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sam, we've been looking for Dad all year.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.72,0:14:52.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我们还没有和他呆上几个小时 关系就已经这么僵了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're with him a couple hours and there's static already?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.60,0:14:55.64,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 听着 我很高兴他安然无恙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. Look, l'm happy he's okay, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.85,0:14:57.64,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很高兴我们在一起工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm happy we're all working together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.85,0:14:59.48,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.60,0:15:03.98,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他就是这样把我们当小孩看待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's just the way he treats us like we're children.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.15,0:15:06.32,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他大叫着命令我们 Dean. -\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Oh, God. - He barks orders at us, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.48,0:15:08.57,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他期望我们什么都不问 只要跟着他就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He expects us to follow them without question.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.74,0:15:10.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他让我们把精力投到那些 需要知道的事情上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He keeps us on some need-to-know deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.16,0:15:12.74,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 他这样做只为一个原因 - 什么原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- He does what he does for a reason. - What reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.91,0:15:14.24,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our job.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.41,0:15:17.58,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有时间争辩 没有机会去犯错 老年人都这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's no time to argue, it's just the way the old man runs things.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.75,0:15:19.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 也许当我们还是孩子的时候还说得过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, maybe that worked when we were kids
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.13,0:15:20.66,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在不行了 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but not anymore.All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.83,0:15:23.08,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少在你和我经历了所有这些事情之后不行了 迪恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not after everything you and I have been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.25,0:15:25.22,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你别告诉我你就这样心甘情愿当个木偶一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You telling me you're cool with falling into line
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.22,0:15:27.42,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让他操作整件事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}letting him run the whole show?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.17,0:15:32.01,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果那是成功的必要条件的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If that's what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.87,0:16:00.87,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喝点啤酒 朋友 这可以让你平静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have some beer, buddy.It'll calm your nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.04,0:16:03.37,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不 谢谢 - 哦 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- No, thanks. - Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.54,0:16:06.38,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你喝够了 我就能从你血中尝到酒的味道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You drink enough, I can taste it in your blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.54,0:16:07.88,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真恶心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.97,0:16:17.39,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你怎么样 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How about you, babe?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.81,0:16:27.44,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乖女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Attagirl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.99,0:16:34.86,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你 - 博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You - Bo
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.03,0:16:36.41,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等卢瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait for Luther.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.47,0:17:00.56,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也想你 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I missed you too, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.27,0:17:03.22,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们有件礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We've got presents.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.98,0:17:11.86,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她看起来很有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She looks interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.95,0:17:19.41,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他就不是了 把他关起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He doesn't. Lock him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.58,0:17:21.41,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.87,0:17:25.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者 直接吃了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On second thought, go ahead and treat yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.87,0:17:28.29,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.38,0:17:35.59,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有样东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.55,0:17:40.09,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这都是他们的吗 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- This all theirs? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.26,0:17:44.47,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是你的一个老朋友的 丹尼尔·埃尔金斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's from an old friend of yours, Daniel Elkins
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.64,0:17:48.31,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我吻到了他的气味 我想让你惊喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I caught his scent and l thought l'd surprise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.48,0:17:50.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯特 你做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kate, what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.98,0:17:53.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我让他受苦 - 你不该那样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- l made him suffer. - You shouldn't have done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.57,0:17:55.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 卢瑟 - 还有其他象他一样的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Luther - There are others like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.57,0:17:58.49,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们知道这个标记 他们会来找我们的 我们不得不小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They'll know the signs and come looking.We have to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.66,0:18:00.82,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢瑟 我是为你做的 为了他对你家人所做的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I did it for you, for what he did to your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.03,0:18:03.41,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是你可能因此被杀死的话 这种复仇就是不值得的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Revenge isn't worth much if you end up dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.08,0:18:10.17,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起 宝贝 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sorry, babe. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.92,0:18:18.51,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以为你会喜欢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought you might like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.68,0:18:21.84,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看起来是在你出生的年代制造的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Looks like it was made around the time you were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.64,0:18:26.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我以前见过这个 - 埃尔金斯死时拿着它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- l've seen this before. - Elkins died with it in his hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.06,0:18:30.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他真该好好练习怎么用枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He should've known better, using a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.07,0:18:35.02,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不是普通的枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is no ordinary gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.19,0:18:37.36,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道了 爸爸 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, Dad. All right, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.57,0:18:39.32,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 下个出口停下 - 为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Pull off the next exit. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.49,0:18:42.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 因为爸爸觉得已经找到了吸血鬼的行踪 - 怎么找到的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Dad thinks we've got the vampires' trail. - How?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.87,0:18:44.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道 他没有说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know. He didn't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.80,0:18:59.76,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 哦 天啊 又来了 萨姆 - 这是怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah, crap. Here we go. Sam! - What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.76,0:19:00.72,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们需要谈谈 - 谈什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We need to talk-About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.88,0:19:02.18,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}About everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.34,0:19:04.89,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们到哪里去 爸爸 这把枪有什么大不了的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where are we going?What's the big deal about this gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.06,0:19:07.31,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们可以再杀了所有的吸血鬼后再解决这事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We can q and a after we kill all the vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.47,0:19:10.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们没有多少时间了 - 上次我见你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- We don't have time for this. - Last time we saw you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.23,0:19:13.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说在一起太危险 现在 突然你又需要我们的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it was too dangerous to be together. Now you need our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.52,0:19:15.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很显然有什么大事情发生了 我们想知道是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Something big is going down and we wanna know what.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.11,0:19:17.61,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 回到车上去 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Get back in the car. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.11,0:19:21.24,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我说回到该死的车上去 - 好 我的回答是 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- l said, get back in the damn car. - Yeah, and l said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.41,0:19:22.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 你已经表明了观点 混小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You made your point, tough guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.16,0:19:25.29,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看 我们都很累了 我们可以晚点再谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're tired, we can talk about this later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.37,0:19:30.08,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你说什么 - 你知道我在说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What'd you say? - You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.25,0:19:31.91,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 你离开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah. You left.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.08,0:19:33.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抛下你哥哥和我 我们需要你的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your brother and me, we needed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.92,0:19:36.51,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你就那样走了 萨姆 就那么走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You walked away. Sam.You walked away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.51,0:19:37.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听下 你们俩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stop it, both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.65,0:19:38.92,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是你叫我不要再回来的 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're the one who said, "Don't come back."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.09,0:19:40.76,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是你关上了门 不是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're the one who closed that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.92,0:19:43.84,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是因为不能再控制我了才发彪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were just pissed off you couldn't control me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.01,0:19:47.18,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}停下 停下 停下 够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Listen. Stop it. Stop it. Stop it.That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.93,0:19:51.27,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那也在说你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That means you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.78,0:20:00.11,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Terrific.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.55,0:20:25.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你喜欢看 是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You like to watch, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.47,0:20:28.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.22,0:20:31.89,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}准备好了吗 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ready, baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.32,0:20:49.12,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们会杀了我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you gonna kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.33,0:20:53.62,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会让你爽翻天 如坠云间的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm gonna take you so high, you're never gonna come down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.87,0:21:33.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}欢迎成为我们一份子 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Welcome home, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.89,0:21:54.22,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know what time it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.39,0:21:55.73,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.27,0:22:02.02,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}狗娘养的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.19,0:22:04.73,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以说他们是真的不怕阳光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So they're really not afraid of the sun?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.90,0:22:07.36,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 直接日照只会晒黑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Direct sunlight hurts like a nasty sunburn.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.53,0:22:11.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}唯一的方法是把他们的头砍下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The only way to kill them is by beheading.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.53,0:22:14.62,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有 他们白天睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And yeah, they sleep during the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.29,0:22:17.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但并不是说他们不会醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Doesn't mean they won't wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.58,0:22:21.46,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我想直接进去不是最好的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So l guess walking right in is not our best option.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.63,0:22:24.59,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实际上 就这么干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Actually, that's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.76,0:22:35.14,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸 如果你需要的话 我有额外的刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, Dad. l've got an extra machete if you need one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.93,0:22:37.73,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事 谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Think l'm okay, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.64,0:22:40.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.82,0:22:48.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.65,0:22:51.78,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们真的想了解这把枪吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You boys really wanna know about this Colt?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.24,0:22:58.16,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.66,0:23:02.46,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是个故事 一个传说 真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's just a story. A legend, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.34,0:23:05.09,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我也那么觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, l thought it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.25,0:23:07.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在读丹尼尔的信以前 我从来都不相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I never really believed it until I read Daniel's letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.67,0:23:12.64,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在1835年 当时哈雷彗星出现在天上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}back in 1835, when Halley's Comet was overhead...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.80,0:23:15.81,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时也是那些人在白杨树下死去的那晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the same night those men died at the Alamo...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.06,0:23:18.68,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们说塞缪尔·柯尔特制造了这把枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they say Samuel Colt made a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.93,0:23:20.31,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特别的枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A special gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.48,0:23:24.81,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是一把为猎人打造的枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He made it for a hunter.A man like us, only on horseback.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.82,0:23:28.32,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个和我一样的人 传说他造了13颗子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The story goes, he made 13 bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.65,0:23:32.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个猎人使用这把枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This hunter used the gun a half dozen times...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.16,0:23:36.12,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在他消失前 这把枪一直跟随他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}before he disappeared, the gun along with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.99,0:23:38.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知何故 丹尼尔得到了它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Until somehow, Daniel got his hands on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.16,0:23:41.62,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They say...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.87,0:23:45.08,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们说这把枪能杀死任何东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They say this gun can kill anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.46,0:23:48.59,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}任何东西？超自然的东西也行吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kill anything, like supernatural anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.38,0:23:51.72,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}例如魔鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Like the demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.88,0:23:53.34,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 魔鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, the demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.59,0:23:56.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每次我发现它们的踪迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ever since I picked up its trail...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.64,0:24:00.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我都要找个方法杀死它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l've been looking for a way to destroy that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.73,0:24:03.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找到这把枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Find the gun...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.11,0:24:06.86,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们可以使用它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we may have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.45,0:25:39.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.85,0:26:06.48,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这边还有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.01,0:26:42.34,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.01,0:26:45.89,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 我是来帮助你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, hey. Shh. I'm here to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.06,0:26:47.39,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.77,0:26:49.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.65,0:27:00.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}孩子们 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Boys, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.86,0:27:02.32,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.71,0:27:12.04,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.54,0:27:15.92,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.72,0:27:23.68,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们不会跟来 他们会等到黑夜来临\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They won't follow. They'll wait till night.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.05,0:27:26.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一旦吸血鬼记住了你的气味 你就跑不掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Once a vampire gets your scent, it's for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.22,0:27:29.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们现在怎么做 你们尽快找到一家最近的殡仪馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What the hell do we do? - You gotta find the nearest funeral home.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.36,0:27:36.44,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么这么久 我应该去帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It shouldn't be taking this long.I should go help.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.69,0:27:39.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩会搞定的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean's got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.41,0:27:48.87,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sammy
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.91,0:27:52.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.33,0:27:55.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没有告诉过你这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I never told you this...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.84,0:28:00.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是你知道在你出生那天 我做了什么吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but the day you were born, you know what l did?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.47,0:28:03.59,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不 - 我为你开了个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- No. - l put a hundred bucks...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.76,0:28:06.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}100美元的帐户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}into a savings account for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.35,0:28:08.76,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我为你哥哥做了同样的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I did the same thing for your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.10,0:28:12.43,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是读大学的基金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was a college fund.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.90,0:28:19.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后每个月 我都会存进100块 直到…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And every month, I'd put in another $100 until...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.65,0:28:23.11,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总之 我的意思是 萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anyway, my point is, Sam...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.28,0:28:28.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这从来不是我想你过的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that this was never the life that l wanted for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.95,0:28:31.16,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那在我离开的时候 你为什么那么生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then why did you get so mad when l left?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.37,0:28:33.62,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你应该明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You gotta understand something.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.96,0:28:37.29,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在你母亲去世后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}After your mother passed...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.67,0:28:41.51,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我所接触的都是些鬼怪 到处都是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}all l saw was evil. Everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.30,0:28:43.97,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我所关心的是要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And all l cared about was
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.30,0:28:46.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让你们兄弟两个好好活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was keeping you boys alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.14,0:28:48.47,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wanted you...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.97,0:28:50.68,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能有所准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.18,0:28:52.64,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}任何时候都有所准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.14,0:28:56.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以在这个过程中…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See, somewhere along the line, I
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.65,0:29:01.32,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不再是你父亲的角色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I stopped being your father...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.53,0:29:06.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而是 成为了你的训练官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and l-l became your-Your drill sergeant.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.12,0:29:12.49,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当你说你要离开去上学的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So when you said that you wanted to go away to school...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.83,0:29:15.96,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我仅仅能想到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}all l could think about, my only thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.12,0:29:20.29,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是你只有一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}was that you were gonna be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.01,0:29:23.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}脆弱而危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.22,0:29:28.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 只是 只是我从来没想到过你到底要什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sammy, it just It never occurred to me what you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.51,0:29:36.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是不能接受事实 你和我 我们是不一样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I just couldn't accept the fact that you and me, we're just different.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.52,0:29:39.86,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.57,0:29:43.98,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们没有什么不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're not different.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.32,0:29:49.07,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不再有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.83,0:29:54.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发生了妈妈和杰西的事后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With what happened to Mom and Jess...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.08,0:30:01.71,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们大概拥有 比任何人都多的共同点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we probably have a lot more in common than just about anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.34,0:30:07.34,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想你是对的 儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I guess you're right, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.89,0:30:13.51,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hey, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.73,0:30:17.39,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大学基金怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whatever happened to that college fund?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.69,0:30:21.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}花在武器上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spent it on ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.40,0:30:29.74,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whew.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.11,0:30:33.08,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}保护些死人还要那么多保安措施\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Man, some heavy security to protect a bunch of dead guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.41,0:30:35.79,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你拿到了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.30,0:30:47.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道该怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.93,0:30:58.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}车有问题吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Car trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.77,0:31:06.73,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我搭你去 带你回我的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me give you a lift, take you back to my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.90,0:31:10.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不了 我可得和恋尸狂划清界限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll pass. I usually draw the line at necrophilia.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.04,0:31:27.96,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}通常要到第二次约会我才会象你这么友好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't normally get this friendly till the second date, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.13,0:31:31.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道 我们可以找点乐子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, we could have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.18,0:31:35.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我总是喜欢交新朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I always like to make new friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.65,0:31:47.19,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.36,0:31:50.69,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从来没有和一个女人呆这么长时间 显然再也不会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't really stay with a chick that long.Definitely not eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.70,0:31:58.29,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.66,0:32:02.12,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无关痛痒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Barely even stings.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.29,0:32:03.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别心急 甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give it time, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.00,0:32:06.46,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}箭浸了死人的血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Arrow's soaked in dead man's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.63,0:32:08.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对你来说是毒药 是不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's like poison to you, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.09,0:32:15.97,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把她关起来 我来对付这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Load her up. l'll take care of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.69,0:32:33.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那这些投进火里 藏红花 臭鼬皮 甘蓝 和延龄草\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Toss this on the fire.Saffron, skunk's cabbage and trillium.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.86,0:32:36.62,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我们准备好以前 这会盖住我们和她的气味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It'll block our scent, and hers, until we're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.78,0:32:38.78,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 这真臭 - 就是这个意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Stuff stinks. - That's the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.95,0:32:42.12,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拍掉身上的灰 你们就有机会不被发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dust your clothes with the ashes and you might not be detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.29,0:32:43.79,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你确定他们会来找她吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You sure they'll come after her?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.96,0:32:45.96,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 吸血鬼很团结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah. Vampires mate for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.42,0:32:48.46,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对为首的来说 她比枪重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She means more to the leader than the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.71,0:32:50.92,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过这个血液疾病会很快消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But the blood-sickness is gonna wear off soon...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.09,0:32:52.88,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以你们时间不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so you don't have a lot of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.05,0:32:54.72,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}半小时应该够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Half-hour ought to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.88,0:32:57.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后我想你们要尽量远离这一带 但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Then l want you out of the area fast. - But
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.22,0:32:59.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一个人不能对付他们全部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad, you can't take care of them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.22,0:33:01.39,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有她和枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll have her. And the Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.56,0:33:04.94,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过后 我们再见面 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But after, we're gonna meet up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.10,0:33:06.81,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一起用这把枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Use the gun together.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.61,0:33:09.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.23,0:33:13.57,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是不是要再次离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're leaving again, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.95,0:33:18.07,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你仍然想一个人追逐那个恶魔？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You still wanna go after the demon alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.91,0:33:21.08,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道 我不理解你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, I don't get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.24,0:33:23.12,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你不能这样对待我们 - 不能怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You can't treat us like this. - Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.29,0:33:25.46,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 象对待孩子一样 - 你们是我的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Like children. - You are my children.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.62,0:33:27.17,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想让你们安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm trying to keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.33,0:33:29.79,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸 无意冒犯 那些都是些鬼话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad, all due respect, but that's a bunch of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.84,0:33:35.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你说什么？- 你知道萨姆和我是怎样猎杀恶鬼的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Excuse me? - You know what we've been hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.30,0:33:37.76,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有些猎物还是你叫我们去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hell, you sent us on a few hunting trips yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.93,0:33:40.97,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你不必那样担心我们的安全 - 这次不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You can't be that worried about us. - lt's not the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.14,0:33:44.18,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是什么？你为什么让我们远离这么重要的战斗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then what is it? Why do you want us out of the big fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.35,0:33:46.02,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些魔鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This demon...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.81,0:33:48.94,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都很厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it's a bad son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.77,0:33:52.69,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我要担心你们的安全的话 我就没有办法做事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't make the same moves if l worry about keeping you alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.86,0:33:54.28,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不能这样不计后果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can't be as reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.44,0:33:55.86,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.82,0:33:59.36,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不希望单一的看待这场战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l don't expect to make it out of this in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.74,0:34:03.37,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们母亲的死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your mother's death...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.29,0:34:06.62,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我伤痛欲绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it almost killed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.54,0:34:13.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能再看着我的孩子死去 我也不会让它发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't watch my children die too.I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.46,0:34:15.34,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是你死了我们怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What happens if you die?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.51,0:34:18.63,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸 你死了我们该怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What happens if you die and we could've done something about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.01,0:34:21.68,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们该做些什么呢 我在想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, I've been thinking. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.85,0:34:23.98,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想也许萨姆在这件事上是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe Sammy's right about this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.98,0:34:24.68,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认为我们应该一起干这件事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We should do this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.14,0:34:29.56,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们一家人团结起来就更强大 爸爸 你是知道这个的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're stronger as a family.We just are. You know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.52,0:34:33.36,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们快没有时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.48,0:34:36.78,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们做你们的事情 离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You do your job and you get out of the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.15,0:34:39.65,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.00,0:34:54.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 有那3个人的踪迹吗 - 没有 有其他的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Any sign of those three? - No. Something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.17,0:34:56.09,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 什么 - 卢瑟 他们砍了汉克的头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What? - Luther, they cut off Hank's head!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.30,0:34:58.84,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯特呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And Kate?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.01,0:35:01.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道 她不在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know. She wasn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.85,0:35:04.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们现在做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.02,0:35:12.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公路上有辆卡车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just a truck, up on the highway.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.86,0:35:19.32,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kate
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.11,0:35:22.11,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她在卡车里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's in that truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.03,0:36:42.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说过我会回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I told you l'd come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.05,0:37:02.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.68,0:37:09.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你是谁 - 我叫温彻斯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Who are you? - Name's Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.97,0:37:12.81,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你朋友在哪里 - 清理你们的窝去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Where are your friends? - Cleaning out your nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.48,0:37:16.81,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯特在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where's Kate?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.56,0:37:19.31,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过来 甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come here, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.24,0:37:28.57,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯特 你没事吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kate, you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.74,0:37:32.66,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}死人的血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dead man's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.20,0:37:34.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}狗娘养的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.96,0:37:39.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要埃尔金斯的枪 作为交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want the Colt, Elkins' gun. A trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.67,0:37:42.67,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是这些吗 我是说 你不能同时对付我们全部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is that what this is about? I mean, you can't shoot us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.17,0:37:44.76,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们会杀了你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.26,0:37:47.51,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 不是用来对付你们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, l don't need it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.68,0:37:49.68,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有其他用途\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm saving it for something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.35,0:37:53.47,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 把枪放下 我就放了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Put the Colt down or she goes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.68,0:37:56.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.85,0:37:58.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别伤害她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just don't hurt her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.86,0:38:07.74,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.53,0:38:11.12,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再远点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Further.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.13,0:38:24.92,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}干得不错 差点就能成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a nice move. You almost made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.16,0:38:59.16,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别动 不然我就拧断他的脖子 把刀放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nope. I'll break his neck.Put the blade down.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.43,0:39:15.26,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You people.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.43,0:39:17.56,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么不能放过我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why can't you just leave us alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.85,0:39:21.06,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们和你们一样有生存的权利 - 我可不那么认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- We have as much right to live as you do. - I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.80,0:39:49.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Luther!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.48,0:40:07.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯特 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kate, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.05,0:40:35.80,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}孩子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, boys...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.18,0:40:41.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.68,0:40:44.02,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们违抗命令回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You ignored a direct order back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.48,0:40:46.48,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是的 - 但是我们救了你的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Yes, sir. - Yeah, but we saved your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.15,0:40:53.78,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.36,0:40:57.91,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是吗 - 你吓死我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- l am-lt scares the hell out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.49,0:40:59.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们是我的所有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You two are all I've got...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.83,0:41:05.37,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜想我们在一起会更强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but l guess we are stronger as a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.88,0:41:11.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 我们追逐这些邪恶的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So we go after this damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.38,0:41:13.72,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一起去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Together.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.59,0:41:16.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes sir.
